{"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/worldsnapshot"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/Se","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SE","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SQ","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WorldSnapshot","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A8SnapshotV","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"title":"WorldSnapshot","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Snapshot.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Snapshot.swift#L33"},"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WorldSnapshot","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/init(from:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/count"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/encode(to:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/Equatable-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"A saved copy of a world’s entities, hierarchy and the components of the listed types.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WorldSnapshot","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Decodable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Se"},{"text":", repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Encodable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SE"},{"text":", repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Component","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use a snapshot to save a world and restore it later, or to compare two worlds. A snapshot"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":", so you can encode it with any encoder, such as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"JSONEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":". Take one with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/snapshot(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", listing the component types to save, and rebuild a world from it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"World(restoring:)"},{"type":"text","text":". Each component type you save must conform to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example saves a world as JSON and restores it:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import Foundation","","var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Position(x: 1, y: 2), Health(current: 3))","let data = try JSONEncoder().encode(world.snapshot(Position.self, Health.self))","","let decoded = try JSONDecoder().decode(WorldSnapshot<Position, Health>.self, from: data)","let restored = World(restoring: decoded)","print(restored[Position.self, of: ship])","\/\/ Prints \"Position(x: 1.0, y: 2.0)\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every entity handle, live or stale, means the same in the restored world as in the original,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so handles you saved elsewhere stay valid. The restored world also hands out the same handles","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from later spawns.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A snapshot holds no resources, hooks or change ticks, and the restored world’s components"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are all added at its first tick. To save resources too, or to save a world without listing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its types at each call, use a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Decoding throws ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DecodingError.dataCorrupted"},{"text":" for data that no world could have","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"produced, such as a component of an entity that isn’t live.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Saving and Loading Worlds","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModu